<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-GRIQUAS 223-3 AT TEA CHASING 340 AGAINST BORDER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GRIQUAS 223-3 AT TEA CHASING 340 AGAINST BORDER.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chasing a target of 340 for victory, Griqualand West were 223 for three at tea on the final day of their Supersport series match against Border at Buffalo Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scoreboard:</p>
<p>Border first innings: 400</p>
<p>Griqualand West first innings: 253</p>
<p>Border second innings: 192-5 declared</p>
<p>Griqualand West second innings: 223-3 (Mickey Arthur 67, Wendel Bossenger 73)</p>
</text>
